    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12816" root="دقر" body-key="d">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دِقْرَارٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دِقْرَارَةٌ</span></b>  <i>A kind of short drawers,
without legs, covering only that portion of the
wearer which decency requires to be concealed;</i>
(TA;) <i>i. q.</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تُبَّانُ</span>: (S, K:) also the latter, <i>trowsers of the ordinary kind;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَرَاوِيلُ</span>; and so
↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُقْرُورٌ</span></b>  and ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دُقْرُورَةٌ</span></b> : pl. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">دَقَارِيرُ</span>.

